    "systemTag": "DELIVERY // GITOPS",
    "statusLabel": "REFERENCE ARCHITECTURE",
    "overviewSummary": "From git push to a production canary. A pull request triggers GitHub Actions, which runs the test matrix and security scans in parallel. Only when the quality gate passes does the workflow build the image, sign it with Cosign, push it with its SBOM and commit the new digest to the GitOps config repo. Argo CD reconciles that repo: staging updates automatically, and production rolls out as a canary that Prometheus metrics can promote or roll back.",
    "brand": {
      "name": "Delivery",
      "accent": "#0f766e",
      "logo": ""
    },
